# THE CRAGS' DEPOT (#68): the plan's old store, a squat winch house cut into a
# shelf at its lip, its cable down to the terrace below. No mast and no light of
# its own (the crags hold no machine light); only its three housings' small
# lamps say whether each is working, open, or dark.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/crags-depot.tour --seed=1 --hour=12 --weather=clear:0 --held=axe_felling
#
# What it shows, in order: the house at noon and at dusk, at the zoom the game is
# played at and backed off; the cable from the terrace below, looking up at the
# lip; each housing head on while it works; and each opened, the yard going dark
# with the third, head on again.

coast calm
place works_the_crags
wait 0.8
await works:the_crags 12
mark yard
zoom 15
wait 0.6
shot 01-noon-z15 with works:the_crags,works_yard,works_lit
zoom 30
wait 0.6
shot 02-noon-z30 with works:the_crags,works_yard
hour 18.6
wait 1.0
shot 03-dusk-z30 with works:the_crags,works_yard
zoom 15
wait 0.6
shot 04-dusk-z15 with works:the_crags,works_yard

# FROM THE TERRACE BELOW, at noon, over the shoulder: the cable comes down off the
# jib to where it is made fast, and the drop it hangs over is the lip.
hour 12
near winch_lip
wait 0.8
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
# Turned back up at the yard once the view is over the shoulder: a body of the
# yard's own walking near the foot draws the view to it otherwise.
face mark:yard
wait 1.0
shot 05-the-cable-from-the-terrace-below with works:the_crags,works_yard,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.8

# EACH HOUSING HEAD ON, working: its own small lamp the only light in the yard.
near feed_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 06-feed-working with works:the_crags,works_lit,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.6
near breaker_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 07-breaker-working with works:the_crags,works_lit,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.6
near coolant_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 08-coolant-working with works:the_crags,works_lit,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.6

# OPENED, one walk each, and the yard dark with the third.
place works_the_crags_feed
wait 0.5
press use 5.5
await works_open:1 14
place works_the_crags_breaker
wait 0.5
press use 5.5
await works_open:2 14
place works_the_crags_coolant
wait 0.5
press use 5.5
await works_dark 14

near feed_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 09-feed-open-and-dark with works:the_crags,works_dark,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.6
near breaker_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 10-breaker-open-and-dark with works:the_crags,works_dark,shoulder
tap shoulder
wait 0.6
near coolant_head
wait 0.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 0.8
shot 11-coolant-open-and-dark with works:the_crags,works_dark,shoulder
